 batch; a complete screen requires eleven actual units and a passing post trial.\\\",\\\"The proposed site is not known suitable until assessed. No shelter or comfort benefit has yet been established.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Test materials and site before committing construction work.\\\",\\\"Keep a safe food reserve and recover energy between substantial efforts.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"branch-screen-study\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I personally construct and test a small woven branch windbreak?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Personal study completed at tick 121: mastered branch-screen.\\\",\\\"The construction contract requires eleven branch units, a suitable footprint and a passing personal post trial.\\\",\\\"At tick 121 start-1-branches visibly held nine branches.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Site suitability, branch condition, post retention and completed construction performance remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Assess a site, test a post and construct a stable screen if actual materials and conditions allow.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Completed personal study.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Suitable site, passing post trial, eleven gathered branches and physical assembly.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Gather an initial batch and assess the proposed footprint; use the results to choose the next trial.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Personal mastery enables practical trials; no physical construction benefit observed.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"root-cultivation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I grow meadow roots reliably?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Planting completed at tick 38, producing plot-37-wren-436.\\\",\\\"At tick 121 the visible plot was established, with progress 1, mature stage, zero stock and capacity four.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Establishment has been observed, but harvestable production and reliability across conditions remain unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Observe establishment and eventual harvestable growth from one planted root.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Completed one planting at (21,8.65).\\\",\\\"Observed the plot established at tick 121.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"plot-37-wren-436\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Actual stock growth and a successful harvest.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Allow ordinary growth time while pursuing construction trials, then inspect again.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"One planted root has visibly established; no harvested food production observed.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

